WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
I don’t care how many years you chase him

2
00:00:01,560 --> 00:00:03,640
This man’s purpose is to get close to you and then get close to Rainbow Dash

3
00:00:04,040 --> 00:00:07,200
I think he just wants to please Rainbow Dash and climb up the ladder. He must be interested in it.

4
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:08,520
The position of the vice president of my hospital

5
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:10,360
Young and ambitious

6
00:00:11,950 --> 00:00:13,070
I'll go back to find Rainbow Dash first.

7
00:00:13,670 --> 00:00:20,970
Baby, where are you hiding?

8
00:00:21,130 --> 00:00:23,480
Where is the baby at table 15?

9
00:00:23,720 --> 00:00:24,640
It's that white and soft one

10
00:00:24,640 --> 00:00:25,600
beautiful fat baby

11
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:26,600
Where is my baby?

12
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:28,080
Being carried away by the handsome guy at your table

13
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:29,320
I saw that the child didn't cry either

14
00:00:30,630 --> 00:00:32,270
It's over. He drugged Rainbow Dash.

15
00:00:32,590 --> 00:00:33,910
Rainbow doesn't like him, why doesn't he cry?

16
00:00:34,310 --> 00:00:37,310
The phone you dialed has been turned off

17
00:00:41,410 --> 00:00:42,970
Hello, I want to call the police

18
00:00:52,540 --> 00:00:54,860
Lin Jingque, Rainbow Dash will be fine, I promise.

19
00:00:55,260 --> 00:00:56,700
My dad directly contacted Director Zhou

20
00:00:56,700 --> 00:00:57,860
He's good at this kind of cases

21
00:00:58,020 --> 00:00:59,260
This year’s three trafficking cases

22
00:00:59,260 --> 00:01:03,800
Is it true that the children are all back safely? I promise.
